body:
@pixelastic Your addition is fine for now and your usecase.

Send a PR :)

***

For more information and future evolution of transformData:

In the future I would like to only provide this:

```js
transformData(collection) {
  collection = collection.map(...).filter(...);
  return collection;
}
```

So that you can do any crazy stuff with the collection passed. For anything lists (so hits, refinement list etc...).

See https://github.com/algolia/instantsearch.js/issues/739 and https://github.com/algolia/instantsearch.js/issues/739#issuecomment-164774874

We need a good name for this and stop documenting original transformData.
